{
  "Npcs.Aiko.DescCorrupt": "Aiko stands before you, a little over 5'4 tall. She has a head of short, unkempt silver-blond hair that ends above her shoulders, parted by two large, furry fox ears. Seven fox tails sway behind her, their fur shaggy and matted down. She wears a set of ragged, bloodied robes that show a lot of skin, her D-cup breasts haphazardly bound by a set of bandages in dire need of changing, and you can smell sex and violence on her even from here. She is wielding an over-sized bill-hook hatchet she can summon and dismiss with a snap of her fingers."
  "Npcs.Aiko.DescPure": "Aiko stands before you, a little over 5'4 tall. She has a head of short silver-blond hair that ends above her shoulders, parted by two large, furry fox ears. Seven fox tails sway behind her, their fur soft and well-groomed. She wears revealing blue and white robes that show off her figure, and carries a longbow that hums faintly with quiet power."
  "Npcs.Aiko.Name": "Aiko"
}
